#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/000
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/000"
msgid "Strength^^Increases the max weight by 1kg per point.^Also increases damage by 1 every 25 points.^^Currently +{0}kg and +{1} damage"
msgstr "Fuerza^^Aumenta el peso máximo en 1 kg por punto.^También aumenta el daño en 1 cada 25 puntos.^^Ahora: +{0} kg y +{1} de daño"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/001
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/001"
msgid "Intelligence^^Adds 1 additional SP and SLP on^level up for every 25 points.^^Currently +{0} SP and SLP"
msgstr "Inteligencia^^Añade 1 PM y 1 PAM adicionales al^subir de nivel por cada 25 puntos.^^Ahora: +{0} PM y PAM"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/002
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/002"
msgid "Dexterity^^Chance in percent to not trigger^a trap when messing with locks.^Adds, together with Luck,^to the chance of avoiding fights.^^Currently {0}% trap avoid chance^          {1}% fight avoid chance"
msgstr "Destreza^^Probabilidad en % de no activar^una trampa al manipular cerraduras.^Junto con Suerte, aumenta la^probabilidad de evitar combates.^^Ahora: {0}% de evitar trampas^       {1}% de evitar combates"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/003
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/003"
msgid "Speed^^Higher speed values let you act earlier in battle.^Every 80 points you can move 1 additional field^per round.^^Currently you can move {0} field(s)."
msgstr "Velocidad^^Más velocidad te permite actuar antes en combate.^Cada 80 puntos puedes moverte 1 casilla más^por ronda.^^Ahora puedes moverte {0} casilla(s)."

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/004
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/004"
msgid "Stamina^^Increases defense by 1 every 25 points.^^Currently +{0} defense"
msgstr "Constitución^^Aumenta la defensa en 1 cada 25 puntos.^^Ahora: +{0} de defensa"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/005
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/005"
msgid "Charisma^^Increases the sell price by 1%^every full 10 points.^^Currently +{0}% sell price"
msgstr "Carisma^^Aumenta el precio de venta un 1%^por cada 10 puntos completos.^^Ahora: +{0}% de precio de venta"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/006
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/006"
msgid "Luck^^Chance in percent to avoid the effect^of an already triggered trap.^Adds, together with Dexterity,^to the chance of avoiding fights.^^Currently {0}% trap effect avoid chance^          {1}% fight avoid chance"
msgstr "Suerte^^Probabilidad en % de evitar el efecto^de una trampa ya activada.^Junto con Destreza, aumenta la^probabilidad de evitar combates.^^Ahora: {0}% de evitar el efecto de trampas^       {1}% de evitar combates"

#. Remake text (Attribute tooltips). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Attribute tooltips/007
msgctxt "Remake/Attribute tooltips/007"
msgid "Anti-Magic^^Chance in percent to block enemy spells.^^Currently {0}% spell block chance"
msgstr "Antimagia^^Probabilidad en % de bloquear hechizos enemigos.^^Ahora: {0}% de bloquear hechizos"

