#. Remake text (Tutorial texts). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Tutorial texts/001
msgctxt "Remake/Tutorial texts/001"
msgid "The buttons in the lower right area of the screen provide many useful functions of "
msgstr "Los botones de la zona inferior derecha de la pantalla ofrecen muchas funciones útiles "

#. Remake text (Tutorial texts). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Tutorial texts/002
msgctxt "Remake/Tutorial texts/002"
msgid "the game. If you are on the main screen you can toggle the buttons by pressing the "
msgstr "del juego. En la pantalla principal puedes alternar los botones pulsando el botón "

#. Remake text (Tutorial texts). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Tutorial texts/003
msgctxt "Remake/Tutorial texts/003"
msgid "right mouse button while hovering the area or hitting the Return key. It will unlock "
msgstr "derecho del ratón sobre esa zona o la tecla Intro. Así se desbloquean "

